{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "74", "x": 0.904017983697097, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.029725264906538765, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "often engage in hobby-based stuff. For instance, they could join a hiking club,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.826136876144627, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "train for a marathon, or attend a painting workshop. Just as the saying goes, \"Birds", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8263382351538997, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of a feather flock together.\" Moreover, friends also make elaborate plans to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8266105414312053, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "celebrate special moments. They might throw surprise parties for each other's", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8260116931760313, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "birthdays, or organize themed gatherings to mark important milestones, such as", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8259899578858247, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "graduations or job promotions.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.31515030209490263, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.025044142118860666, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "It really depends. Generally speaking, friends tend to relate better to", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.7660642249118619, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "personal choices like career shifts or dating dilemmas. For example, if you're torn", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.8262947645734865, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "between settling down and focusing on your career, friends might give unbiased", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.8260550612314908, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "advice, whereas parents would probably push for marriage. That said, when it", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.8266094136567135, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "comes to major moves like relocating abroad, cutting off contact with your family", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.8261856780226381, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "isn't a wise option, as you need their support in many ways, such as practical input", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.8262946620485326, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "on visa arrangements, financial support, or even childcare help. At the end of the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8267192178822385, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "day, it's a balancing act.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.24822831753577582, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.025648859927639937, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, definitely. To be honest, it's completely normal to get ideas from", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.7656658129413764, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "friends when planning ahead. I mean, seeing people you trust do something similar", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.8262076183627524, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "does give that initial sense of security. But the thing is, if we just mirror their", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.8264906897602075, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "choices without proper reflection, things can get messy quickly. Take degree", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.8259466923553191, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "choices for instance: I've noticed that loads of students go into fields like", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.8260116931760313, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "marketing or computer science simply because their social circle does. The", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "problem kicks in when they realise their strengths don't align with the coursework", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.8263817057343129, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "at all; you can imagine the stress that follows. That's why I firmly believe that when", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7745958190513854, "w": 0.8261859855974996, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "it comes to major life decisions, we should build plans around our natural talents", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.8260987368618117, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and core values. After all, we're all wired differently.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.5363086741339691, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8879420400242081, "w": 0.020609553398225476, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, that's a classic dilemma. Think about it: how many of us end up in jobs", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.8879420400242081, "w": 0.7656006070707565, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "exactly matching our degree titles? Don't get me wrong: career-driven degrees", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9162723900983457, "w": 0.8266602660338006, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}